{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202500","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202500","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1120250001:1":{"text":"Wait, Kojin! Aren't you going back? You've been walking in the same direction as us for a while now...","source_cn":"等等！库金，你送得太远了！这里距离黑嚎的领地……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CD80F8B1950B410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120250002:2":{"text":"Actually... I'm not going back.","source_cn":"其实……我已经不打算回黑嚎了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80BAEB920CA3491B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120250003:1":{"text":"I spoke to Kruger, and as of today, I'm leaving the Grimmaw Clan.","source_cn":"我和克鲁格说过了，从今天开始，我会离开黑嚎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB84CC897B16CCC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120250004:1":{"text":"From now on, I'll rely only on my own strength. I'll build up a new clan and lead them to the top.","source_cn":"接下来，我会依靠自己的力量，建立全新的氏族，然后带领我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAE27D566FCC0B7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120250005:1":{"text":"Just like you guys did before.","source_cn":"就像你们过去曾经做到的那样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20A8FDF9F0BC5577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120250006:1":{"text":"One day, Soren, my tribe will be recognized and respected by all, just like the Uru Clan.","source_cn":"索恩，总有一天，我的部落会像乌尔氏族一样，得到所有人的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4C5CDF25A05F7F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120250007:1":{"text":"I wish you well, then.","source_cn":"那就祝福你吧……希望——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x129CFCBF41640F00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120250008:1":{"text":"I hope to see you at the next Warsong Festival.","source_cn":"下一次的战歌节上能见到你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA76143028238AE62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120250009:1":{"text":"Certainly. And at that time, I'll win back everything I lost.","source_cn":"当然。到那时候，我会把之前输掉的都赢回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC20F13F00BFF20FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120250010:1":{"text":"Good luck... brother.","source_cn":"那我就等着看了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF68DB3166CFF20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","v